WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.960
The Chinese Communist Party recently
proposed a constitutional amendment to

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.570
abolish term limits on the presidency.
This change would allow the current

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:17.430
president to remain in power after his
second term elapses in 2023. The bottom

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.279
line is that President Xi's extended
tenure will likely lead to more

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:24.090
repression at home and more
assertiveness abroad. Domestically, he's

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.029
rooted out his political enemies through
a broad sweeping anti-corruption

00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:29.670
campaign. Moreover, the core of Xi Jinping thought,

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:33.059
now enshrined in the Chinese
Constitution, is that the party controls

00:00:33.059 --> 00:00:37.829
everything. Xi is not a reformer. Freedom
of information and expression have

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:42.239
already been reduced under his rule, and
we can expect this to continue. While

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:45.480
greater repression won't be popular for
the Chinese people, greater international

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.800
assertiveness likely will be. Judging by
China's involvement in various economic

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.280
and military initiatives, Xi is
comfortable with pursuing power and

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.360
influence abroad. He's also initiated the
deepest military reforms in China's

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:01.739
history, and once those are complete,
China may move to blatant use of force

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:06.200
to achieve, in Xi's words, "the
rejuvenation of the Chinese nation".

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:10.780
What do you think the implications are of an indefinite ruler in China? Let us know in

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:14.340
your comments. Also, let us know what
other topics you'd like our scholars to

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.720
cover in 60 seconds, and be sure to like
and subscribe for more research and

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.890
videos from AEI.

